ot be recovered from the compressed copy."}},{"question_id":"5(c)(ii)","parent_question":5,"topic":"compression method choice","marks":3,"command_word":"identify and justify","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Oakfield Food Co-op is modernising its stock-control system. This is an original comp.school fixture scenario."},{"type":"text","value":"Identify and justify 3 accurate points about data compression."}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"Award marks for accurate, relevant points about data compression; accept equivalent original wording."},{"type":"list","items":["Lossy methods are unsuitable when every original detail must be preserved.","The chosen method should balance quality, size and intended use.","Compression reduces the number of bits required to store a file."]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Lossy methods are unsuitable when every original detail must be preserved.","marks":1},{"criteria":"The chosen method should balance quality, size and intended use.","marks":1},{"criteria":"Compression reduces the number of bits required to store a file.","marks":1}],"model_answer":[{"type":"text","value":"A strong response applies these data compression ideas to the fictional organisation:"},{"type":"list","items":["Lossy methods are unsuitable when every original detail must be preserved.","The chosen method should balance quality, size and intended use.","Compression reduces the number of bits required to store a file."]}]},"learning_guidance":{"hints":["For the stock-control system, focus on data compression. Consider why the organisation might want the same file to use less storage or transfer capacity.","Ask whether the recovered file must match the original exactly or whether some loss of detail would be acceptable.","For each of your 3 points, explain why the property matters to the stock-control system. Link related details where useful, and make the reason explicit rather than only naming a feature."],"model_answer":"- Lossy methods are unsuitable when every original detail must be preserved. The organisation should retain exact data for the stock-control system where missing details would change its meaning.\\n- The chosen method should balance quality, size and intended use. The organisation should compare file size and acceptable quality for the actual use in the stock-control system.\\n- Compression reduces the number of bits required to store a file. This can reduce the storage required by files used in the stock-control system."}},{"question_id":"5(d)","parent_question":5,"topic":"copyright legislation","marks":1,"command_word":"identify","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Northbridge Community Library is improving its digital services. This is an original comp.school fixture scenario."},{"type":"text","value":"Identify one accurate point about impacts of digital technology."}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"Award marks for accurate, relevant points about impacts of digital technology; accept equivalent original wording."},{"type":"list","items":["Automation can improve efficiency while changing the kinds of work people do."]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Automation can improve efficiency while changing the kinds of work people do.","marks":1}],"model_answer":[{"type":"text","value":"A strong response applies these impacts of digital technology ideas to the fictional organisation:"},{"type":"list","items":["Automation can improve efficiency while changing the kinds of work people do."]}]},"learning_guidance":{"hints":["For the library’s digital services, focus on impacts of digital technology. Identify the people affected by the proposed digital change.","Compare a possible improvement with a possible disadvantage for a different stakeholder or resource.","Build one distinct point about impacts of digital technology; give each its own precise meaning rather than repeating a term or turning it into an unrelated example."],"model_answer":"Automation can improve efficiency while