a key."]}]},"learning_guidance":{"hints":["For data exchange between the bike-hire devices, focus on systems software. Think about the work needed to make hardware and applications usable.","Separate the management of running resources, stored files, user access and recovery.","For each of your 4 points, explain why the property matters to data exchange between the bike-hire devices. Link related details where useful, and make the reason explicit rather than only naming a feature."],"model_answer":"- Memory management allocates memory to running programs. This allows applications used in data exchange between the bike-hire devices to share available RAM.\\n- File management organises stored files and folders. This helps the organisation find and update the records used in data exchange between the bike-hire devices.\\n- User management applies accounts and permissions. This lets the organisation restrict access to the tools and records needed for data exchange between the bike-hire devices.\\n- Backup utilities create recoverable copies of data. This provides a way to restore the data needed for data exchange between the bike-hire devices after loss or damage. Encryption utilities transform readable data using a key. This helps protect stored information used in data exchange between the bike-hire devices from someone who lacks the decryption key."}},{"question_id":"2(b)","parent_question":2,"topic":"utility software","marks":3,"command_word":"explain","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Harbour Arts Centre is planning a new online booking service. This is an original comp.school fixture scenario."},{"type":"text","value":"Explain how systems software is relevant to this situation. Link each point to the needs of the organisation."}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"Award marks for accurate, relevant points about systems software; accept equivalent original wording."},{"type":"list","items":["Backup utilities create recoverable copies of data.","Encrypti