 documentation makes a system easier to maintain.\\n- The solution should meet the stated user need."}},{"question_id":"7(d)(i)","parent_question":7,"topic":"cloud storage benefits","marks":3,"command_word":"describe","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Greenway Bike Hire is reviewing how its devices exchange data. This is an original comp.school fixture scenario."},{"type":"text","value":"Explain how secondary storage is relevant to this situation. Link each point to the needs of the organisation."}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"Award marks for accurate, relevant points about secondary storage; accept equivalent original wording."},{"type":"list","items":["Magnetic storage can provide high capacity at a relatively low cost.","Optical media can be useful for distributing or archiving modest amounts of data.","Capacity, speed, durability, portability and cost affect the choice of storage."]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Magnetic storage can provide high capacity at a relatively low cost.","marks":1},{"criteria":"Optical media can be useful for distributing or archiving modest amounts of data.","marks":1},{"criteria":"Capacity, speed, durability, portability and cost affect the choice of storage.","marks":1}],"model_answer":[{"type":"text","value":"A strong response applies these secondary storage ideas to the fictional organisation:"},{"type":"list","items":["Magnetic storage can provide high capacity at a relatively low cost.","Optical media can be useful for distributing or archiving modest amounts of data.","Capacity, speed, durability, portability and cost affect the choice of storage."]}]},"learning_guidance":{"hints":["For data exchange between the bike-hire devices, focus on secondary storage. Consider the files that must still exist after the device is switched off.","Compare the demands of keeping a large collection, accessing it quickly and protecting it from loss.","Link each technical point to an effect on data exchange between the bik