cal network.","A router forwards packets between different networks.","Client-server networks centralise services and administration.","Network performance is affected by bandwidth, latency, traffic and transmission media.","A local area network connects devices across a limited geographical area."]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"A wide area network connects devices across a larger geographical area.","marks":1},{"criteria":"A switch forwards frames to the intended device on a local network.","marks":1},{"criteria":"A router forwards packets between different networks.","marks":1},{"criteria":"Client-server networks centralise services and administration.","marks":1},{"criteria":"Network performance is affected by bandwidth, latency, traffic and transmission media.","marks":1},{"criteria":"A local area network connects devices across a limited geographical area.","marks":1}],"model_answer":[{"type":"text","value":"A strong response applies these computer networks ideas to the fictional organisation:"},{"type":"list","items":["A wide area network connects devices across a larger geographical area.","A switch forwards frames to the intended device on a local network.","A router forwards packets between different networks.","Client-server networks centralise services and administration.","Network performance is affected by bandwidth, latency, traffic and transmission media.","A local area network connects devices across a limited geographical area."]}]},"learning_guidance":{"hints":["For the stock-control system, focus on computer networks. Identify which devices or locations need to exchange information.","Distinguish the scale of the connection, the equipment carrying data and the way shared services are managed.","Weigh a benefit against a limitation for the stock-control system, then decide which matters most to co-op staff. Support the conclusion with those reasons."],"model_answer":"A wide area network connects devices across a larger geographical area. This c