ed information used in data exchange between the bike-hire devices from someone who lacks the decryption key.\\n\\nAn operating system manages hardware resources and provides a user interface. This allows people and applications to use the devices supporting data exchange between the bike-hire devices."}},{"question_id":"10(a)","parent_question":10,"topic":"WAN definition","marks":1,"command_word":"define","content":[{"type":"text","value":"A local games studio is testing a prototype made with invented data. This is an original comp.school fixture scenario."},{"type":"text","value":"Explain how computer networks is relevant to this situation. Link each point to the needs of the organisation."}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"Award marks for accurate, relevant points about computer networks; accept equivalent original wording."},{"type":"list","items":["A wide area network connects devices across a larger geographical area."]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"A wide area network connects devices across a larger geographical area.","marks":1}],"model_answer":[{"type":"text","value":"A strong response applies these computer networks ideas to the fictional organisation:"},{"type":"list","items":["A wide area network connects devices across a larger geographical area."]}]},"learning_guidance":{"hints":["For testing the games prototype, focus on computer networks. Identify which devices or locations need to exchange information.","Distinguish the scale of the connection, the equipment carrying data and the way shared services are managed.","Link each technical point to an effect on testing the games prototype. Make the reason for that effect explicit, without assuming facts about the organisation that the scenario does not give."],"model_answer":"A wide area network connects devices across a larger geographical area. This could connect the sites or remote services needed by testing the games prototype."}},{"question_id":"10(b)","parent_question":10,"topic":