ital services by extending equipment life and using appropriate recycling."}},{"question_id":"11","parent_question":11,"topic":"smartphone upgrade impact","marks":8,"command_word":"discuss","content":[{"type":"text","value":"A fictional school robotics club is preparing for a demonstration. This is an original comp.school fixture scenario."},{"type":"text","value":"Discuss how computer science should be used in this situation. Develop both benefits and limitations before reaching a justified conclusion."}],"answer":{"guidance":[{"type":"text","value":"Award marks for accurate, relevant points about computer science; accept equivalent original wording."},{"type":"list","items":["Inputs, processing and outputs should be identified clearly.","The design should be tested using representative data.","Security and privacy should be considered from the start.","The chosen approach should be justified against relevant constraints.","Clear documentation makes a system easier to maintain.","The solution should meet the stated user need."]}],"marks_breakdown":[{"criteria":"Inputs, processing and outputs should be identified clearly.","marks":2},{"criteria":"The design should be tested using representative data.","marks":2},{"criteria":"Security and privacy should be considered from the start.","marks":1},{"criteria":"The chosen approach should be justified against relevant constraints.","marks":1},{"criteria":"Clear documentation makes a system easier to maintain.","marks":1},{"criteria":"The solution should meet the stated user need.","marks":1}],"model_answer":[{"type":"text","value":"A strong response applies these computer science ideas to the fictional organisation:"},{"type":"list","items":["Inputs, processing and outputs should be identified clearly.","The design should be tested using representative data.","Security and privacy should be considered from the start.","The chosen approach should be justified against relevant constraints.","Clear documentation makes a syst